submittedParameters.prompt:
Use case: stylized-concept. Production world industry atlas, exactly NINE complete separate compounds, strict 3 by 3 grid. Target2048 square, real transparent alpha. Each complete compound must fit 80% of its cell width/height with wide transparent gutters, no parts touching neighbors, all rows filled evenly.
Same 2:1 orthographic isometric southeast camera and daylight top-left. Match first two reference images' jade-green/teal, warm ivory and fine gold, rounded Taoist chibi hand-painted finish; match third reference world art's ground camera and fine material detail. These are usable world buildings, NOT UI icons or framed buttons. Full intact buildings on THIN grey stone/soil rhombus base, no thick island. No text/people/watermark/checkerboard.
Left-to-right top-to-bottom:
1 iron ore mine: dark red-brown open ore face and short steel conveyor, grey hoist tower and jade-roof ore store, raw reddish ore heaps;
2 tropical fruit plantation: rows of round orange/citrus fruit trees, small jade-roof packing barn and stacked fruit baskets, green farm earth;
3 rubber plantation: orderly slender rubber trees each with a small tapping cup, pale rubber sheets drying under jade canopy, tiny cream storehouse;
4 desert water supply pumping station: round open pale turquoise reservoir, ivory-and-gold pump house with jade roof, copper water pipes and 2 filter tanks, NO huge waterbackground;
5 municipal water tower: tall round ivory stone tank on four stout columns with teal curved roof cap, small base pump hut, copper pipe down side;
6 tropical goods factory: broad ivory pavilion workshop, large grouped square commodity crates, copper vats and distinctive double jade roof with side courtyard; not same shape as previous factory;
7 tropical farm: low cream farmhouse, jade-roof grain barn, upright silo, maize field plot and leafy banana clump, no animals;
8 tropical lumber mill: broad tropical log stacks, dark timber sawing canopy and jade-roof office, broadleaf tree by rear, open timber loading yard; visually different from temperate waterwheel mill;
9 toyland cotton-candy forest: stand of fluffy pastel pink and cream cotton-candy trees on slim caramel trunks, small jade-roof collection hut and cotton bundles; readable botanical plantation, restrained candy colors fitting same refined jade/ivory palette.
All separate distinct silhouettes. Fine handpainting with crisp edges, soft shading, no pixel art, no glossy plastic, no photorealism.

